 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGroupe Horizon SA                                              MASTER SERVICES\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, 69001 Lyon, France                     AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR97 223734983\n\nFROM                                                          FACTURÉ À\nGroupe Horizon SA                                             Groupe Horizon SA\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo                                         45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n69001 Lyon                                                    13001 Marseille\nFrance                                                        France\nVAT: FR97 223734983\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 28/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Groupe Horizon\nSA, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Lyon (\"Party A\"), and Groupe Horizon SA, with its registered office at 45 Avenue\nVictor Hugo, Marseille (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\nParty A      Groupe Horizon SA / Sophie Bernard\nParty B      Groupe Horizon SA / Pierre Martin\nDate         28/02/2026\n\n## Barcodes:\n\nBarcode: 3218581886778\n\n---",
